<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cairn has 90 pct of Command.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cairn has 90 pct of Command.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cairn Energy Plc said on Friday that it held 90 percent of Command Petroleum Ltd and would not increase its offer.</p>
<p>The U.K. independent producer's A$1.10 per share cash bid now closes on December 12, after being extended from Thursday's previous closing date.</p>
<p>Cairn said there may still be some Command shareholders who mistakenly believed the offer did not recognise the full value of the Australian company's stake in the Ravva oilfield off the coast of India. Command shares were one cent higher at A$1.10 on Friday. -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
